  <item>
    <title>Vol.213 TheWeeknd的季候风在HongKong吹得那么凶</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aee328159687ba320b2ab7c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aee328159687ba320b2ab7c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 19:34:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>if you ever change your mind, I'm waiting in Hong Kong</span></p><p><span>【主播】@天音Tainn, 因为有季候风的关系，我终于幸运地成为听过不止starboy就去现场的歌迷</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">2:54</a> 去看周末欧巴的机缘是好多kpop歌手去了首尔场 让我也看看什么叫世男一</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">6:01</a> 他不断不断地发王菲给人一些幻想</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">8:32</a> 四倍溢价挂在顶楼 好贵的票！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> 我身边疑似懂潮流的人都去参加的活动我也要去一去</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 和季候风的初相识：作为一个港风全抗拒的王菲和盆栽音乐的文盲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1619">26:59</a> 第一次看到hongkong MV 好懂大众审美的娓娓道来的外国人在香港的邂逅 以及当代审美的配器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> 叙事结构的变化带来的救赎感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a> 英文的加入给到香港的另一面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2346">39:06</a> 微妙地捕捉到了借来的城市借来的时光的漂泊感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">40:34</a> 香港是用来暂住的城市</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">48:51</a> 只是经验丰富的制作人讨巧的怀旧吗 可他出生在多伦多士家堡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3179">52:59</a> 突然大流行但围垦叔叔像一个推流平台所有人传播的都是王菲的那四句</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3422">57:02</a> 现场听它的观感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 当香港场的观众都是大陆游客他们竟然不用调理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3863">1:04:23</a> The Weeknd演唱会像服务于网红打造个人IP的造景 姿态各异又整齐划一的美女们排很久姿态又很专业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4905">1:21:45</a> Tokyo是比HongKong更酷的音乐吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5180">1:26:20</a> 同期热播中或许是下集预告的后会友期和再婚皇后</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5395">1:29:55</a> 季候风的回响：香港会有人等你的心境&nbsp;</span></p><br><br>]]></description>
