  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.210 巴黎度过的夏天2.0我也是过上了每天堵在卢浮宫的日子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8f92332e27ea5b21fbd8e1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a8f92332e27ea5b21fbd8e1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 01:13:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>活在别人的梦想中，原来是这样的感觉～</span></p><p><span>【主播】@天音Tainn, 永远站在巴黎这一边</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 先去一趟韩国给自己囤点好物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 与我的洲际飞行挚爱阿联酋航空的重逢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> 入住时好心的职员陪我进行CIUP tour</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 从南法庄园开始开启我的巴黎城市观光购物之旅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> 怎么这么会啊？巴黎人开学典礼给安排塞纳河游船</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2014">33:34</a> 只有9度的第一周</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2144">35:44</a> 如果你用inspire来理解巴黎地图</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">43:52</a> 法网观赛攻略</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3032">50:32</a> 火灾后重生的巴黎圣母院</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3528">58:48</a> 在法网周边为乌拉鹿重新买到坐垫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3640">1:00:40</a> 名声在外的花神咖啡店像20世纪的校内太平洋吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3806">1:03:26</a> 并不推荐的field trip去圣米歇尔山奚梦瑶的芍药还插在柜台</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4503">1:15:03</a> 继续巴黎漫游：新香水小件装/LebonMarche/卢浮宫附近的日餐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4906">1:21:46</a> 抽空周末去Art Basel再次刷新对艺术圈的见解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5358">1:29:18</a> Fieldtrip第二场莫奈花园的植物超繁杂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5794">1:36:34</a> 为总是拍不上的巴黎写真购入歌剧院tutu裙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5996">1:39:56</a> 突然得到的人气歌谣搭子还陪我去老佛爷做jellycat去巴黎铁塔拍写真</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6237">1:43:57</a> 繁忙的游客行程：奥赛宫廷菜/杜乐丽圣火再碰头/凯旋门看法国队世界杯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6508">1:48:28</a> 两年间巴黎好像变得更文明整洁了？也可能是美国实在拉低下限</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6674">1:51:14</a> 庆祝韩法140年的巴黎人气歌谣 那时候真的不是大清吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7757">2:09:17</a> sololtrip罗马最优解：约拍！从许愿池横穿帝国大道去斗兽场 你看两千年前确实有人在这里生活 是古罗马的城砖修起新罗马的教堂和现代罗马的大屏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8670">2:24:30</a> 三天去了三次米兰大教堂的人 意大利男人真的好会勾引你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8982">2:29:42</a> 到底是谁会买邀请函看时装周的秀啊？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9639">2:40:39</a> 面子Prada上班视频都出了我还没出门 愤而购入天价图包上面子火还是米兰物价贵啊？？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10158">2:49:18</a> 什么中本悠太来了？？？现在就收拾行李回巴黎</span></p><br><br><br>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIJEOZNVFBP1bYwTNGjjG.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=55058479&amp;track_id=1008899458&amp;uid=266381341&amp;jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/75ed-audiofreehighqps/1F/46/GKwRIJEOZNVFBP1bYwTNGjjG.m4a" length="83712867" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:52:21</itunes:duration>
